Description:
Double-barrel, high-quality Russian hunting shotgun.
It's longer barrel gives it a much tighter spread than most shotguns.
Primary fire fires each barrel individually. Secondary fires both at once, with doubled spread and recoil.
If you have only one shell in the chamber, the secondary fire fires the second barrel, effectively letting you roll shots in quick succession.
Tapping fire instead of holding it down lets you rapid-fire shots.